==Battleground==
*The enemy base is protected by a [[Base Barrier]] until the boss is defeated.
*10 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 4.67 seconds<sup>140f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 14.67 seconds<sup>440f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mysterious Calamity]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 1.33~2 seconds<sup>40f~60f</sup>.
**2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 66.67~80 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,400f</sup>.
**2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
**5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

